# MAD Ventures Holdings LLC — hosting redirects
#
# Retired public route. The DecivantIQ venture was sunset and is no longer a
# MAD Ventures initiative. Both the bare and trailing-slash forms are retired
# permanently to the companies index.
#
# SYNTAX: Cloudflare Pages `_redirects`. The rule is `<from> <to> <status>`.
# The `!` force modifier is NETLIFIX-only and is NOT supported by Cloudflare
# Pages — a rule carrying it is ignored. The earlier `301!` was therefore
# invalid here and has been corrected to plain `301`.
#
# The destination carries a trailing slash to match `trailingSlash: true` in
# next.config.ts, so the redirect does not spend a second hop normalising.
#
# STATUS: AUTHORED BUT UNVERIFIED. These rules are only exercised once
# deployed. The redirect is NOT active on the live domain today.
#
# This file must contain no catch-all rule. A `/*` splat would make every
# unknown path return 200 with the homepage, which would suppress out/404.html
# and produce indexable soft-404s. Verified by scripts/verify.mjs.

/companies/decivantiq   /companies/   301
/companies/decivantiq/  /companies/   301
